      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_01",
          "content": "只有孩子对我笑的时候，我才敢肯定他或她爱我。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_02",
          "content": "我总是知道孩子想要什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_03",
          "content": "我喜欢思考孩子为什么会有那些行为和感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_04",
          "content": "孩子会在陌生人面前哭，是为了让我难堪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_05",
          "content": "我能够完全看透孩子在想什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_06",
          "content": "我经常琢磨孩子心里正在想什么、感受如何。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_07",
          "content": "我觉得自己很难真正参与孩子的假扮游戏。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_08",
          "content": "我总能预料孩子接下来会做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_09",
          "content": "我常常好奇孩子正在经历怎样的感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_10",
          "content": "孩子有时生病，是为了让我没办法做自己想做的事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_11",
          "content": "我有时也会误解孩子的反应。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_12",
          "content": "我会尝试从孩子的角度来看待事情。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_13",
          "content": "孩子闹脾气时，只是为了故意惹我生气。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_14",
          "content": "我总是知道自己为什么要以某种方式对待孩子。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_15",
          "content": "当孩子表现得不合适时，我会试着理解背后的原因。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 14,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_16",
          "content": "孩子的行为常常让人难以理解，以至于我懒得再去弄清原因。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 15,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_17",
          "content": "我总是知道孩子为什么会有那样的行为。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 16,
          "responseSetKey": "prfq_agree_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "PRFQ18_18",
